	(text "I2S matches breadboard / square_wave_test.c:\nBCK = IO33   LRCLK = IO32   DIN = IO25\nUART: TXD0/IO1 and RXD0/IO3\nEN RC + ESP_EN on pin 3, IO0 strap on pin 25.\n\nRotating the symbol only moves pin *positions*.\nPin numbers do not change — re-attach labels after rotate.\n\nANT1 = 2.4 GHz U.FL/IPEX pigtail (BOM only).\nMates to the 32U on-module U.FL. No GPIO, no PCB antenna."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
